  "notable_quotes": [
    "Zn-dmtrz-mip also delivers CO2/CO selectivities of 110.0 for 50/50 and 50.8 for 10/90 mixtures, outperforming many reported MOFs.",
    "Breakthrough tests achieved 99.9% N2, CH4, and CO product purity and 99.5% CO2 recovery, confirming effective binary and ternary separations.",
